Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope that we'll never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting\Nplans, we'll reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We are home from the horizon.\NOut on the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a place that\NI want to take you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way we already know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together. I'm\Ntelling you, in our path, I trust that it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Will lead us to another sea, untattered.\NCause now we are home on the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,out on the edge of the world\NThere is a place that I want
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,to take you to Let's head for\Nit then But after the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,we already know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.88,0:02:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's team had intended to use Peckham's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,as a guide to Big Mom\Non Whole Cake Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.90,0:02:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,However, thanks to his\Nsudden disappearance,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,they had little choice but to\Nfollow Pudding's directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Peckham's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We should look for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I wouldn't even\Nknow where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.64,0:02:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to trust the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't have anything to be\Nafraid of if we aren't spotted,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,so hopefully this path will work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.56,0:03:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are we now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We've barely left port.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, we're still near Cacao Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I see an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of snacks they'll have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We know from the smell that it's\Ngoing to be something sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.26,0:03:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the map, it's\Nprobably going to be jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.76,0:03:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.06,0:03:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But we won't be stopping there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.20,0:03:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon as we see jam island, then we turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll follow the directions\Nof Log Pose, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.86,0:03:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's jam, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet, yummy jam!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A miracle island of jam, and\Nyou're just going to ignore it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.46,0:03:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Starboard, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's three o'clock to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.39,0:03:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Going right is the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:04:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Going right to Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Free jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have Sanji bake stuff for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard starboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.44,0:04:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.76,0:04:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not very good at\Nthis, are you, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you could do any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.22,0:04:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweet jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.02,0:04:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,According to Pudding,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.16,0:04:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If we turn towards the next island before
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.48,0:04:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,getting too close to\Nthe one in front of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,we can avoid the surveillance\Nnetwork and sneak by.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.92,0:04:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how you read the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you steer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I'll take it from\Nhere if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.55,0:04:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll cook up\Nsome dinner for us. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.28,0:04:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.66,0:04:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.22,0:04:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.64,0:04:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta go cook. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna mess up this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, you aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm cooking, no\Nmore kitchen for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, but I'm not paying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.30,0:04:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want money! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.26,0:05:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try, Pedro. Switch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help the team, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.24,0:05:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.74,0:05:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.65,0:05:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The water's grape-colored!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It is! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There is an island that\Nspills juice around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no harm to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.63,0:05:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean we can drink the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is paradise!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro, you know a lot about\Nthis place. Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been here once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.42,0:05:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A giant sea centipede. They\Nreside in the waters around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Taste my blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, on Hallscake Island...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Crocambush!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir! Mama! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.32,0:06:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.34,0:06:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's condition is acting up again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.56,0:07:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We must take action. Tout suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.00,0:07:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What is our request, c 'est Giri?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A cheeky one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.82,0:07:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.40,0:07:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the heck would we even start?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.62,0:07:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the one with all the\Ncream puffs piled up, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.02,0:07:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Beaucoup complique.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, actually, I may\Nhave just la solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.58,0:07:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't there a tourist group of cream\Npuffs staying at a hotel nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.44,0:07:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid they checked out this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.72,0:07:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have to make one, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.56,0:07:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.94,0:07:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to do something\Nspecial with the dough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.86,0:07:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me some almonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.88,0:07:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My chef contacts the Minister of Nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.56,0:07:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama is currently en route to Sweet City.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She's coming here to the capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What if she destroys her Shit Royale?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't talk her out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems she's completely lost her senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.76,0:08:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The death toll is still rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.12,0:08:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Issue an evacuation order, immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.32,0:08:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a crocodile can stop Mama's\Nrampage now. This way! Quickly now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.56,0:08:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, can you not please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me my croquembush, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.14,0:08:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet City's under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.38,0:08:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's headed towards downtown!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's hunger pains are always\Nbad, but this is catastrophic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.44,0:08:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They always just pop up out\Nof the blue. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.08,0:08:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Until she gets a bite of whatever\Nshe craves, she will not stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And can't be stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just evacuate the residence!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all we can do! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's having one of\Nher tantrums! Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.26,0:08:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is her city!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll wreck your own castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.62,0:09:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No use.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.74,0:09:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I want cro-ke-boosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cro-ke-boosh, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.00,0:09:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the flavor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.22,0:10:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.70,0:10:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Governor Moscato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The minister of gelato and 16th\Nson of the Charlotte family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.80,0:10:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's one of Mama's children,\Nthen I'm sure he can do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.18,0:10:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Moscato speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.01,0:10:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.92,0:10:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's our status and where\Nis that croquembouche?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.04,0:10:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Regretablement, le chasset will be at\Nleast another half hour before he's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.66,0:10:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be far too late by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't allow her to destroy the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.24,0:10:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.15,0:10:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You must stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, it's Moscato!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.48,0:11:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is my croquembush, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,because all I want is croquemotia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.14,0:11:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, the chefs are making\Nit as fast as they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please just give us 30 minutes\Nand we'll have it ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.18,0:11:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away, Moss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.86,0:11:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no stopping her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And let her destroy the whole capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you recognize your own son?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.78,0:11:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it life or treat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, anything but life or treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.68,0:12:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's going to steal his lifespan away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's your own son! Stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get your dessert soon enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.78,0:12:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy! Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you have some\Nwhipped cream while you wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,An appetizer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that sound tasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The treat is just not ready. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.90,0:12:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're gonna be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I said life or treat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.74,0:12:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please no. Keep your cool, moss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.92,0:12:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you show fear then your lifespan\Nwill be taken away from you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't do this mama I won't\Nstop here anymore I promise I beg you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,spare my money!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.88,0:13:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty years!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Governor Piscato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She murdered her own son?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.10,0:13:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:13:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can stop her now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What a tragic state of affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.14,0:14:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody's coming down the\Nriver of juice. Is that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,it can't be but it is\Neveryone out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.74,0:14:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.88,0:14:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.72,0:14:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get gobbled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.98,0:14:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And look, here's a crooked bush.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have caught those tourist\Ngreen puffs when they left the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.18,0:14:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that beautiful blaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The minister of candy's work, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.12,0:14:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.56,0:14:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare get in my\Nway. Open wide, round!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that is yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.30,0:15:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.24,0:15:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's rampage has ended at last! Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.96,0:15:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That really hit the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm delicious, then I can die happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.56,0:15:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.64,0:15:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give the chefs a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.40,0:15:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The crisis is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.02,0:15:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We must summon all the ministers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.22,0:15:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest our lack of a daily\Ntime for the big tea party!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.90,0:15:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kimbei, what a pleasure it is to see\Nmy loyal Knight of the Sea here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.72,0:16:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me, I never thanked you\Nproperly for bringing me that poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Only wish I could read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.56,0:16:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma-ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.24,0:16:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.50,0:16:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.68,0:16:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it seems there's been some\Nremodeling done here in the city
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Might this be your work?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, ma'am. I arrived here just a moment\Nago. I haven't a clue what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.40,0:16:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can spare but\Na moment of your time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.08,0:16:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There are some things I would\Nlike to speak to you about today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.14,0:16:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to\Nleave my crew, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:16:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have faith in Straw Hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and I am confident that he\Nwill change this world someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.06,0:17:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He is young, I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but I do not believe that\Nany of the four emperors
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.32,0:17:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,have what it takes to\Nbecome king of these seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.26,0:17:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But Straw Hat Luffy isn't like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.68,0:17:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That boy is something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I've decided that I\Nwant to lend him my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.84,0:17:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,More than that, I want to join his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.32,0:17:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to ride upon his ship, and I\Nwant to dedicate my life to his journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.40,0:17:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.98,0:17:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe the world he creates will be a\Nworld where fishmen are truly free at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:17:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We all know plenty about Luffy,\NJinbe, if we're being frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.96,0:18:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been going on and on\Nabout him for the past two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't disagree with\Nyour decision, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.44,0:18:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to join Luffy that\Nmuch, then maybe you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I talk about him that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.84,0:18:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go, Jean-Babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.54,0:18:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.30,0:18:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.80,0:18:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even complain, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.74,0:18:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We totally get how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.42,0:18:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, you quit your job\Nin the Neptune Army to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you're a pirate, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.96,0:18:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just a bunch of\Nslaves from Marie Joie,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.56,0:18:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but you were willing to do\Nanything to fight by our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.44,0:18:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when you joined the Warlords,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,you only did it to advance the\Nstatus of us fishmen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.90,0:18:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Same with big mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you got all buddy-buddy with\Nher to protect the Ryugu kingdom You throw
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the name of an emperor around and even the\Nreal tough guys will get off your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything you've done\Nhas been to help our
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.12,0:18:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,people you turned our whole lives around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done enough for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.88,0:19:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.98,0:19:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Captain now is your\Ntime break out and be free
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you gotta do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.58,0:19:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to start living for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Going where you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.82,0:19:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.10,0:19:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we're cool with\Nthe captain leaving,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.10,0:19:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling Big Mom ain't\Ngonna be too happy about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.96,0:20:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If she gets mad, then all\Nhe can do is run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe better to swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.06,0:20:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.97,0:20:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But then what's Aladdin supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.74,0:20:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a member of Big Mom's family\Nsince he's married to Lady Prawlane.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.28,0:20:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't worried about\Nlittle old me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.34,0:20:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sha, sha, sha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you naughty boys talking\Nabout me behind my back? Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.58,0:20:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she hear us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.86,0:20:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hiding something from\Nme, my darling little hubby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Aladdin, fuss up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.72,0:20:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mama got angry at your crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,were you gonna scurry off\Nin the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.22,0:20:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and leave me behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, uh, I would ask you first, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.74,0:20:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think you need to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose you over Mama\Nany day of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.46,0:20:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have to leave,\Nthen take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so passionate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.26,0:20:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Waratsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I just brought you here,\Nand I'm already leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I love being with these\Nguys, so I'm still happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what say you, Praline?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Mama forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.66,0:21:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, will she forgive\Nus if I try to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.58,0:21:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.92,0:21:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Others have tried it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know exactly how the negotiations\Nwent, but I know that they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.14,0:21:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Commander Mascotto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He just wanted to protect\Nus and now he's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.68,0:21:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to get off, Mascotto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.84,0:22:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We've finally decided to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.60,0:22:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and take him away. Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.52,0:22:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.46,0:22:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.28,0:22:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.96,0:22:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.28,0:22:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell if I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.40,0:23:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you cross mama, this is what's gonna\Nhappen to you even if you're her child.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.34,0:23:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, so you really want\Nto leave me, Jinbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.56,0:23:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.20,0:23:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.20,0:23:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you love us anymore? Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.56,0:23:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask someone why they're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.68,0:23:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how pathetic that sounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.08,0:23:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it matter, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.28,0:23:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe is a pirate, and we\Nalways live the way we choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.20,0:23:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, having a\Npledge of loyalty reneged.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.34,0:23:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,brings shame to a leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.50,0:24:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, I'm losing a very\Npowerful asset here. Namely, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.06,0:24:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.36,0:24:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.20,0:24:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm losing something, you should, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.24,0:24:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you have to pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.84,0:24:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.00,0:24:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me the roulette!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.18,0:24:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.08,0:24:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now spin it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.54,0:24:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's see what\Nyou lose, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.88,0:24:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.68,0:25:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Luffy and company continue\Ntheir trek to Whole Cake Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.92,0:25:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.72,0:25:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we're not making\Nmuch progress, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.68,0:25:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.59,0:25:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to start a\Ncampfire and take a nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.44,0:25:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And get attacked by those ants again?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.58,0:25:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.16,0:25:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,At night time, the syrupy\Nseas get cold and solidify.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.84,0:25:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When the sun rises, it'll\Nbegin to flow again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.30,0:25:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us these things beforehand next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.76,0:25:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just melt this batch of starch syrup, and\Nhopefully we'll be on our way in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.06,0:25:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.86,0:25:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.77,0:25:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not exactly safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.64,0:25:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I only put those sea ants to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.80,0:25:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna be mad when they wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.02,0:25:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, undoubtedly so.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.46,0:25:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Those ants can eat an entire ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.48,0:25:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd know since it happened to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.26,0:25:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Hey, Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.76,0:26:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you came here\Nonce before, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.72,0:26:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro and Peckhams?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.14,0:26:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They used to be pirates\Nand traveled here together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.82,0:26:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.73,0:26:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have told me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.92,0:26:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.14,0:26:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought of myself as a grand explorer,\Nbut I soon became a wanted man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.56,0:26:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, I only accompanied\NPeckhams half the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.46,0:26:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please keep this story between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.34,0:26:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to help Master Catviper.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.26,0:26:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So I was scouring these\Nwaters for Poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.90,0:26:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But when I trespassed in Big Mom's\Nterritory, it became my last voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.84,0:26:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I faced a devastating defeat here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.38,0:26:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't talk about this often.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.52,0:26:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro I never knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.74,0:27:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You have bad memories,\Nbut you still came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.06,0:27:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If my experience helps then it will all\Nbe worth it if you Karoo can rescue Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.46,0:27:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides this might be a chance to\Nrectify my failure from last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.94,0:27:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that Yugara\Nwent to the whale tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.38,0:27:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And that our kings showed\NYugara the road ponglyph there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.02,0:27:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quite a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.04,0:27:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.94,0:27:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No one outside the Kozuki\Nclan has seen that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.06,0:27:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In nearly 26 years or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.18,0:27:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Specifically since they showed\Nit to Goldie Roger and his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.40,0:27:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The king of the pirates was there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.04,0:27:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes And after that, he sailed to\NLaugh Tale and earned that title.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.82,0:27:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.36,0:27:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Dogstorm and Master\NCatviper think Yugara
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.12,0:28:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,have the same qualities\Nthat Roger possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.18,0:28:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They showed Yugara the\NRoad Poneglyph because
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.96,0:28:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,they believed you might need it someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.08,0:28:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your plan after\NYugara defeat Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.98,0:28:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too far ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.84,0:28:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't even thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.48,0:28:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If you, Karoo, want to see this through,\Nyou'll need Big Mom's Road Poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.62,0:28:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're this far into her territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.12,0:28:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,it might be your best, if not\Nonly, opportunity to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.12,0:28:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So in addition to taking back Sanji,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.60,0:28:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe we should steal Big\NMom's Road Poneglyph as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.10,0:28:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But can we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.14,0:28:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But rescuing Sanji might\Nbe hard enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.48,0:28:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin did ask me about\Nit, but I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.22,0:28:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe after we save Sanji? I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.68,0:28:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get the Poneglyph,\Nyou, Karoo, get Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.04,0:28:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That satisfactory?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.14,0:29:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,When we reach the island, can\Nyou, Karoo, buy me a little time?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.12,0:29:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I won't fail again. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.96,0:29:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.00,0:29:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're doing\Nthis for us, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.26,0:29:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.24,0:29:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be hard enough to keep Sanji safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.12,0:29:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Rescuing him is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.20,0:29:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.68,0:29:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.26,0:29:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. It's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.94,0:29:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we talk this through?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.62,0:29:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I wonder,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.08,0:29:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,do things work out for Luffy because\Nhe was born under a lucky star?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.38,0:29:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that, Brooke?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.58,0:29:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.49,0:29:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lucky myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.96,0:29:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.70,0:29:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.78,0:29:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.69,0:29:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The ants woke up! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.48,0:30:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.39,0:30:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the Snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.88,0:30:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.36,0:30:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.32,0:30:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoho?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.28,0:30:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.58,0:30:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.26,0:30:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So we finally made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.10,0:30:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh ho ho ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.56,0:31:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one fancy-looking island!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.12,0:31:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the kind of\Nplace an emperor lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.42,0:31:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a big cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.74,0:31:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The tallest cake there\Nis actually a castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.66,0:31:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, that's where\NBig Mom lives. Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.22,0:31:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, should I keep steering\Nus straight? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.74,0:31:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're headed to that cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.52,0:31:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a hole in the security net.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.12,0:31:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.03,0:31:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's gone just like Pudding said.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.30,0:31:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.21,0:31:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish there was some way to\Nthank her for all her help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.86,0:31:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If we hadn't met her, I don't know\Nif we would have made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.72,0:31:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That is so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.84,0:31:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.44,0:31:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody's on the shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.94,0:31:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.92,0:31:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.48,0:31:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.39,0:31:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
